text:
I used to come here a lot a couple years back. I lived around the corner from here so it was always a delight n beautiful escape at the time. I stopped coming after i moved twice out of Tampa n now sense it looks like I'm permanent at the moment i get to drop by sometimes to zero until i was shot right in the boob by cupids arrow Ouch!!! Lol now with a lovely lady in my life i get to come back to this cute store n find my own slice of heaven again. Store is clean, the staff is friendly n the lattes are legit paired better with those ridiculously godly tasting treats! I been hooked on Chestnut praline latte! Taste waaay better hot, it's nutty n creamy. Hits the spot right! I pair it with the pumpkin loaf, some days I replace the loaf with the spinach feta cheese wrap. That one is a play in flavors. Like cheese bitter notes n fluffy white eggs. Be warned! This one if warmed? It's hella hot! Lol my definition of warm; is put in mouth you will be ok. It is not a put in mouth right away. Let it chill there n build up your anticipation!. I also tried the pastries, nice n sweet. The cake pops hit a higher sweet index in my mouth but im neutral to no way unless i have deep space nine black interstellar coffee. I can't do sweet+sweet it hits me like a brick. Snow man cookie? It's actually pretty fucking good! Im hit n miss with these types. But this one was well balanced paired with a bitter, unless u can handle sweet stuff. I did pumpkin cream last month n I love it in both iced n in latte. Im a pumpkin everything girl! :3 
I recommend this business BUT!!!;
Keep in mind that this location gets bombarded HARD!! It's always full n you may not find seats during lunch hours. It's neutral to crazy in the morning. Im weirded out that it's nice and slow now, i been here sense 5am to now 6:35am just 1-4 people. N they mostly leave. They have a nice system for the Dashers, uber drivers or just online orders. Go straight in n pickup at side window (inside). Sense I'll be coming back more, I will update my latte n snacks as i try em. Thanks for reading n have a blessed day!

Pleasant and cozy shop with friendly baristas and a killer "Red Eye". This shop is my first choice on State and I've never been disappointed yet.

I would definitely recommend this shop and remember;

"Coffee should be served black as the night, hotter than Hell and sweeter than a womans' heart.."

5 from my perspective but i saw a couple instances where others would rate at the 3.5-4 star. I used to come to this one a lot but sense my Luv works in another one i rather go to that one. Kiss two birds with one heart shaped stone. I can see the difference between a regular SB store vs Drive through one like this. The time window is huge! I think like most places they are understaffed to. Holiday week can do that to any business. Nice line of cars outside for window service n a medium one inside to. The staff was doing what they do best n were on task. Well mannered n positive vibes. The madam before me had a hiccup order but it wasn't written in the cup as she wanted it. No biggie the barista doing the mixes fixed it on the spot. Place was packed by the time i got my orders coming out. To my knowledge i think it's faster to just get out of your car n walk inside. I like coming inside anyways. I love the human interaction better. Cuz whats the point without it? Might as well just stay home n make yourself a mean cup of joe your way. Be in your pjs n cuddle up with a nice bottle of inspiration n the dogos. Lol i saw the place was well kept inside, they had an unfinished creative board with a high quality Japanese Manga style barista being painted in pastels. Don't know who did it but here's a boat load of support from another Artist n professional illustrator; 
"your art is superb quality, even if it's a hobby? N / or if not? Chase that dragon with full intent of making it yours! You have a beautiful talent that to my very steep n high expectations of this style of art? It matches with my own standards. It is very well done. Make it to sell in posters or even prints. You will get that money fast! Pair yourself with a writer n build your dreams together or if you are just like me? Write draw, paint n publish your beautiful art, i would love to see more of your work!"
Blessings to all n hope you all work n flourish this coming holidays!
